      "value": "@{602d3bd675defb333e431d1b|full_name} Ideally, I'd rather there be a one time use token system or something like again, ownership transfer, where the original author can hand out tokens to specific people. My main issue with avatar cloning right now isn't what you mentioned about friends sharing avatars with people - I trust my friends and most commission me and understandably don't want just anyone having the avatar, either. I take issue with avatar search worlds, especially ones where the creators of them make it difficult to contact them or simply don't respond when contacted. In my opinion, a solution for this should have been made and prioritized a long time ago, especially since VRC wants a whole \"creator economy\" or whatever.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
