      "value": "@{602d3bd675defb333e431d1b|full_name} There are already options for everything else like Worlds, Portals, and Groups, cloning feels overlooked for so long.  Could be setup the same as Worlds easily, a Friends+ means that Friends of Friends can clone the avatar, just like Friends of Friends can join worlds, what's the difference?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
