      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{68101580c2584ec1a1903aaf|full_name} I don't honestly care who copies what or whether anything makes sense in the end BUT I will suggest that joining an instance of a world marked Friends+ isn't the same as cloning an avatar. I frequently create an instance of my private world, I mark it Friends+ . That means people can join. If instead they copied my avatar their friends, etc. could clone it ad infinitum. An asset is not the same as a world. In any case what does \"a friend\" mean in the context of VRC? It is a button click.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
