      "value": "@{602d3bd675defb333e431d1b|full_name} I'm sorry you have zero value in those you add to your friends list like that. The definition of a Friends+ instance means that anyone who is a friend of a friend (daisy chaining to infinity) can join that instance, and the same concept would apply to a Friends+ Avatar Cloning restriction in my example, I'm sorry you don't understand that.",
