      "value": "@{68101580c2584ec1a1903aaf|full_name} I believe I understand the concept of \"friend\". I hear people gossip about their VRC friends all the time. People accept friend requests and remove them periodically. Some people are on friends lists because they need to know where those people are because they are pests. The reality is one often wants to share \"something\" with those around them and not necessarily forever and especially friends of friends of friends.",
